  "id": "personality-psychology",
  "term": "personality psychology",
  "definition": "Personality psychology is the area of psychology that conceptualizes normal personality and its development, including how self-function is organized. In the supplied source, it is described as viewing the self in two linked aspects: identity and social interdependence versus autonomy.",
